@startuml
' Figure 42.2  The decision record
' Reading order: the review writes exactly one record. The record's
' six parts run in order: context, options, decision, evidence,
' consequences, revisit. At least two options, one chosen, each loser
' with its reason. The record names an owner and a signer who is not
' the owner, and lives in the store. From review.record.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
class Review <<org>>
class Record <<evidence>> {
  context
  decision
  consequences
  revisit: date, trigger
  owner, signer
}
class Option <<evidence>> {
  chosen
  why_not
}
class Evidence <<evidence>> {
  link
}
class Store <<org>> {
  due()
}
Review -down-> "1" Record : writes
Record *-right-> "2..*" Option
Record *-left-> "1..*" Evidence
Store o-down-> "*" Record
@enduml
